							"text": "SELECT PeriodEndDate, SOURCESYSTEMCODE, COUNT(1)\r\nFROM BNKM.CUSTOMERCOUNTRYOFCITIZENSHIP\r\nWHERE (PeriodEndDate IS NULL\r\nOR PeriodEndDate = '9999-12-31') AND (SOURCESYSTEMCODE = 'CRM' OR SourceSystemCode = 'SEC' OR SourceSystemCode = 'CCD')\r\nGROUP BY PeriodEndDate, SOURCESYSTEMCODE"
